ModeTran	 	-	Transmission control mode	Powertrain	Transmission control mode, veh #1	Transmission control mode	State	Control option for transmission, from configurable function MODE_TRANS or imported variable. -1 is reverse, 0 is neutral, 1 specifies open-loop mode, 2 and higher specify a closed-loop limit (maximum gear available to the controller). The current gear in closed-loop mode is Gear_CL. The current gear in open-loop mode is Gear_OL.
ModeTran_2	ModeTrn2	-	Transmission control mode	Powertrain	Transmission control mode, veh #2	Transmission control mode	State	Control option for transmission, from configurable function MODE_TRANS or imported variable. -1 is reverse, 0 is neutral, 1 specifies open-loop mode, 2 and higher specify a closed-loop limit (maximum gear available to the controller). The current gear in closed-loop mode is Gear_CL. The current gear in open-loop mode is Gear_OL.
ModeTran_3	ModeTrn3	-	Transmission control mode	Powertrain	Transmission control mode, veh #3	Transmission control mode	State	Control option for transmission, from configurable function MODE_TRANS or imported variable. -1 is reverse, 0 is neutral, 1 specifies open-loop mode, 2 and higher specify a closed-loop limit (maximum gear available to the controller). The current gear in closed-loop mode is Gear_CL. The current gear in open-loop mode is Gear_OL.
ModeTran_4	ModeTrn4	-	Transmission control mode	Powertrain	Transmission control mode, veh #4	Transmission control mode	State	Control option for transmission, from configurable function MODE_TRANS or imported variable. -1 is reverse, 0 is neutral, 1 specifies open-loop mode, 2 and higher specify a closed-loop limit (maximum gear available to the controller). The current gear in closed-loop mode is Gear_CL. The current gear in open-loop mode is Gear_OL.
